DIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.142) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nPaste as Replacement overrides original node names with automatically generated names when pasting multiple nodes with a parent -> child relationship:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df4b2cb3-1ad2-4ad1-9793-54a10c0b19c1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new scene.\n- Add a child node and a subchild to that node.\n- Select both the child node and the subchild and press <kbd>Ctrl + C</kbd> to copy the nodes.\n- Press <kbd>Alt + V</kbd> to paste the nodes as a replacement of the currently selected nodes.\n- Notice how the subchild node loses its name. Attempting to undo/redo won't restore the original state fully (with the original node name).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rock